WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.525
First: an agency already runs the
Zero Trust Assessment monthly.

3
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:08.225
Can it stop running ScubaGear?

4
00:00:08.225 --> 00:00:09.400
The answer is b, no.

5
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:15.105
CISA's directive names CISA's SCuBA tools,
and ScubaGear covers Exchange Online,

6
00:00:15.105 --> 00:00:18.378
Teams, SharePoint and
Power Platform policies

7
00:00:18.378 --> 00:00:21.063
the Zero Trust Assessment doesn't test.

8
00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:25.937
Second: a test is skipped with the
reason not licensed Entra I D P two.

9
00:00:25.937 --> 00:00:27.075
How is it counted?

10
00:00:27.075 --> 00:00:29.988
The answer is c: skipped, licensing.

11
00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:33.876
It's a licensing decision,
neither a failure nor a pass.

12
00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:38.860
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
